    {
        "content": "<p>adamrk opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15027\">PR #15027</a> from <code>adamrk:abk/http-body-peek-bug</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>When a guest passes an http request/response to the host and the body contains a host provided <code>StreamProducer</code>, we take the fast path of downcasting the stream to the underlying <code>http::Body</code>. But if the guest read from the stream before passing it on, there may be a buffer of data that was read out of the <code>StreamProducer</code>, but not handled by the guest.</p>\n<p>This change ensures that that buffered data is included when downcasting to an <code>http::Body</code>. Otherwise it will be silently dropped.</p>\n<p>Resolves <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15020\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15020</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 635380491,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1793105543
    },
