    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15027#discussion_r4392113875\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>could <code>oneshot::channel().0</code> be split into a separate assignment with a <code>let</code>, e.g. <code>let (tx, _) = oneshot::channel()</code>?</p>\n</blockquote>",
