    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15027#discussion_r4392135160\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Could we move this from a comment to a reason with <code>ignore =</code>? See <a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/attributes/testing.html#the-ignore-attribute\">https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/attributes/testing.html#the-ignore-attribute</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
